      "author": "Ines Kowalczyk",
      "text": "storefront-web is on the impact basis: 2 touched modules at the 05-01 analysis with the banner behind its flag, not the 4 from first triage. The edge-widget change uses the 1-run class and its own set.",
      "ts": "2026-05-04T10:31:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Tobias Wendel",
      "text": "An expedited bench would be mine to approve; nobody has asked.",
